		<DeletedComponentTemplates />
		<Id>265</Id>
		<Name>ERCOT Real-Time System Conditions (HTML)</Name>
		<IsMockTemplate>false</IsMockTemplate>
		<Description>Fallback for the ERCOT Grid Conditions API Poller template (scripts/api-pollers/ercot-grid-conditions.apipoller.template): reads the same real-time numbers off ERCOT's Real-Time System Conditions HTML page with a PowerShell script run on the polling engine, for the values the JSON endpoints do not carry (Instantaneous Time Error, BAAL exceedances, Average Net Load, wind and PVGR output, the DC_S tie) and as the route to take if the API Poller's [-1:] slice paths turn out not to be supported. See docs/guides/ercot-grid-dashboard.md.

Prerequisites: outbound HTTPS from the polling engine to www.ercot.com. No credential is needed; assign to the polling engine's own node.</Description>
		<Tags>
			<TagInfo>
				<Name>ERCOT</Name>
				<TemplateID>265</TemplateID>
			</TagInfo>
			<TagInfo>
				<Name>PowerShell</Name>
				<TemplateID>265</TemplateID>
			</TagInfo>
			<TagInfo>
				<Name>HTTP</Name>
				<TemplateID>265</TemplateID>
			</TagInfo>
		</Tags>
